            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="16">
                <start-time>00:01:33,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,880</end-time>
                <translation>虽说如此</translation>
                <original>ということですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="17">
                <start-time>00:01:34,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,700</end-time>
                <translation>哎呀 我今天也有点兴奋</translation>
                <original>ねえ今日もちょっとワクワク</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="18">
                <start-time>00:01:36,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,875</end-time>
                <translation>虽然是悲剧 但就是兴奋不已</translation>
                <original>悲劇だけどワクワクでございます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="19">
                <start-time>00:01:38,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:40,780</end-time>
                <translation>那么 岛田老师 这次的主题是</translation>
                <original>さあ島田さん今回のテーマは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="20">
                <start-time>00:01:40,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:44,200</end-time>
                <translation>炙烤出人的本质
人間の本質を炙り出す</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="21">
                <start-time>00:01:44,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,623</end-time>
                <translation>所谓本质或本性</translation>
                <original>本質とか本性というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="22">
                <start-time>00:01:46,623</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:49,425</end-time>
                <translation>用英语就叫“自然（nature）”呢</translation>
                <original>よく英語だとネイチャーって言いますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="23">
                <start-time>00:01:49,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,275</end-time>
                <translation>人本身就蕴含着一种“自然”</translation>
                <original>人間は一つの自然を抱え込んでいて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="24">
                <start-time>00:01:53,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,575</end-time>
                <translation>它有时会像自然界的风暴一样</translation>
                <original>それが時々自然界における嵐のようにね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="25">
                <start-time>00:01:58,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:02,475</end-time>
                <translation>化为暴力喷发出来</translation>
                <original>暴力となって噴出したりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="26">
                <start-time>00:02:02,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,340</end-time>
                <translation>或者留下思想</translation>
                <original>まああるいは思想を残すという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="27">
                <start-time>00:02:04,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:07,175</end-time>
                <translation>人与动物的差异就在这里</translation>
                <original>その動物の差がありますから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="28">
                <start-time>00:02:07,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,775</end-time>
                <translation>恋爱也是一种“自然”呢</translation>
                <original>恋愛も一種の自然ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="29">
                <start-time>00:02:10,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:12,325</end-time>
                <translation>要对此进行分析的话</translation>
                <original>それを分析していくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="30">
                <start-time>00:02:12,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:14,975</end-time>
                <translation>那就是用于分析人类的自然的</translation>
                <original>人間のネイチャー分析としての</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="31">
                <start-time>00:02:14,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:17,875</end-time>
                <translation>“文学”一概念就浮现出来了</translation>
                <original>文学というのが現れてくるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="32">
                <start-time>00:02:17,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:19,380</end-time>
                <translation>人的自然？</translation>
                <original>人間のネイチャー</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="33">
                <start-time>00:02:19,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,380</end-time>
                <translation>我们就是人嘛 所以哪怕不思考这个“自然”</translation>
                <original>人間だから ネイチャーと思ってなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="34">
                <start-time>00:02:22,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:25,320</end-time>
                <translation>每天就也在做很多事嘛</translation>
                <original>いろんなことを日々してるじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="35">
                <start-time>00:02:25,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,740</end-time>
                <translation>“自然”具体是指什么呢？</translation>
                <original>具体的にどういうことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="36">
                <start-time>00:02:26,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,775</end-time>
                <translation>人类拥有语言能力</translation>
                <original>人間というのは言語能力とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="37">
                <start-time>00:02:29,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,000</end-time>
                <translation>以及创造出自然界原本不存在之物的能力</translation>
                <original>本来自然界にないものも作り出していく能力を持ってしまったので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="38">
                <start-time>00:02:35,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:36,706</end-time>
                <translation>过度发达的大脑
肥大化した脳が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="39">
                <start-time>00:02:36,706</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:40,325</end-time>
                <translation>让人类对动物不会烦恼的那些事情</translation>
                <original>動物だったら思い悩まないようなことも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="40">
                <start-time>00:02:40,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:42,275</end-time>
                <translation>也会陷入烦恼</translation>
                <original>思い悩んでしまうという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="41">
                <start-time>00:02:42,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:44,100</end-time>
                <translation>由此产生了纠葛</translation>
                <original>葛藤が生じてしまってね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="42">
                <start-time>00:02:44,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,525</end-time>
                <translation>变得不明所以</translation>
                <original>わけわからなくなるという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="43">
                <start-time>00:02:46,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:49,500</end-time>
                <translation>正因为怀抱着这种矛盾</translation>
                <original>この矛盾を抱え込んでいるがゆえに</original>
