            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="368">
                <start-time>00:19:50,801</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:53,272</end-time>
                <translation>在我印象中 这是第一次有人</translation>
                <original>僕の中でここまで分かりやすく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="369">
                <start-time>00:19:53,272</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:55,986</end-time>
                <translation>如此浅显易懂地剖析了寻找自我的危险性
