            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="397">
                <start-time>00:21:26,298</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:29,620</end-time>
                <translation>电视上不是也常有那种在医院被抱错的视频吗</translation>
