            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="410">
                <start-time>00:22:05,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:08,344</end-time>
                <translation>-哇 好厉害 既是弃子又是寻找自我的故事 -两者都是</translation>
                <original>-うわすごい捨て子と自分探しの話だ -両方だ</original>
