            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="413">
                <start-time>00:22:14,805</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:16,420</end-time>
                <translation>我之所以觉得这部剧之所以有人气</translation>
                <original>人気出るわけだなと思うのは</original>
