            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" torder="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" index="421">
                <start-time>00:22:46,887</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,006</end-time>
                <translation>人们常常憧憬更帅气的自己</translation>
                <original>しばしば人はもっとかっこいい自分</original>
